      "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0",
      "artist": "Alan Stark from Goodyear, AZ, United States",
      "description": "A rainbow was created by a full moon rising directly behind me as I took this shot.  Sometimes referred to as a \"moonbow,\" this is a rare occurrence given the number of variables that have to be just right for one to form.  This moonbow rose over the historic Arizona mining town of Jerome.",
